[l_braz_por]
operation_capture_cipher=Capturar cifra
operation_capture_cipher_desc=Capturar um livro de códigos inimigo ou adquiri-lo por outros meios, daria aos nossos decifradores uma importante vantagem em seus esforços.

[l_english]
operation_capture_cipher=Capture Cipher
operation_capture_cipher_desc=§LCapturing an enemy codebook, or acquiring it by other means, would give our codebreakers a decisive advantage in their efforts.§!

[l_french]
operation_capture_cipher=Capturer le code
operation_capture_cipher_desc=§LMettre la main sur un livre-code [From.GetAdjMS], quelle que soit la façon dont c'est fait, pourrait donner aux déchiffreurs un avantage considérable.§!

[l_german]
operation_capture_cipher=Chiffre erobern
operation_capture_cipher_desc=Ein feindliches Codebuch zu erobern oder auf andere Weise in unseren Besitz zu bringen würde unseren Codeknackern einen entscheidenden Vorteil verleihen.

[l_japanese]
operation_capture_cipher=暗号の解読
operation_capture_cipher_desc=§L敵の暗号帳を手に入れる、または他の手段で取得することで、我々の暗号解読に決定的な利点を与えることができるだろう。§!

[l_korean]
operation_capture_cipher=암호 탈취
operation_capture_cipher_desc=§L적의 암호 책자를 탈취하거나 다른 방법을 통해 입수한다면, 우리의 암호 해독 능력에 결정적인 돌파구가 될 수 있습니다.§!

[l_polish]
operation_capture_cipher=Zdobądź szyfr
operation_capture_cipher_desc=Przejęcie wrogiej książki szyfrów znacznie ułatwiłoby pracę naszych kryptologów.

[l_russian]
operation_capture_cipher=Захватить шифр
operation_capture_cipher_desc=§LЗахватив или раздобыв иным способом вражескую книгу шифров, мы окажем нашим дешифровщикам неоценимую помощь.§!

[l_simp_chinese]
operation_capture_cipher=夺取密码
operation_capture_cipher_desc=§L夺取敌马的密码本，或通过其他手段拿到手，我们的密码破译马员将获得决定性优势§!

[l_spanish]
operation_capture_cipher=Capturar clave
operation_capture_cipher_desc=Si capturamos un libro de códigos enemigo o lo conseguimos de otra forma, nuestros descifradores tendrán una ventaja decisiva en su labor.
